82,0,RTEX 노드 주소 설정 이상 보호,"On power up of the control power, node address setting rotary switch on the servo drive has been set to a value outside the valid value.",Check the setting of the node address setting switch.
,,,,Set node address setting switch to a value within the range of 0 and 31 and then turn on control power to the servo driver.
83,0,RTEX 연속 통신 이상 보호 1,An error with the reading data received by a local node continued for a specified period.,Check the communication cable for excessive noise.
,,,"Note) This alarm assumes an error if CRC error, receiving failure, or cyclic data error occurs.","Check the communication cable for length, layout arrangement and connections."
,,,,Communication cable must be category 5-e or higher (6 or higher grade is recommended) shielded twisted pair cable (STPC) specified by TIA/EIA-568.
,,,,"Replace the cable with the one recommended as above, if not a recommended one."
,,,,Attach the ferrite core to the cable if effective.
83,1,RTEX 연속 통신 이상 보호 2,Reading error of the data delivered to the local node was continued for predetermined period.,Check the communication cable for excessive noise.
,,,"Note) This error is set by occurs either for CRC error, received missing and cyclic data error.","Check the communication cable for length, layout arrangement and connections."
,,,,Communication cable must be category 5-e or higher (6 or higher grade is recommended) shielded twisted pair cable (STPC) specified by TIA/EIA-568.
,,,,"Replace the cable with the one recommended as above, if not a recommended one."
,,,,Attach the ferrite core to the cable if effective.
84,0,RTEX 통신 시간 초과 이상 보호,No communication data was received and no signal to start receive interrupt handling was received from MNM1221 (RTEX communication control ASIC) for a specified period.,Check to see that the cable is disconnected or broken.
,,,,"Check that the upstream node is ready for transmission (power is ON, not reset)."
,,,,Make sure that the host device can transmit the signal at the correct timing and speed.
,,,,The communication cycle set by Pr7.20 (RTEX 통신 사이클 선택) must match the transmission cycle of the host device.
,,,,Check the communication cable for excessive noise.
,,,,"Check the communication cable for length, layout arrangement and connections."
,,,,Communication cable must be category 5-e or higher (6 or higher grade is recommended) shielded twisted pair cable (STPC) specified by TIA/EIA-568.
,,,,"Replace the cable with the one recommended as above, if not a recommended one."
,,,,Attach the ferrite core to the cable if effective.
84,3,RTEX 동기화 및 초기화 이상 보호,Error occurred during communication and servo sync and initialization process.,"전원을 끄고 다시 켠다. 그래도 표시가 나타나고 에러가 발생하는 경우에는 고장일 가능성이 있습니다. 사용을 중지하고 모터, 서보 앰프를 교환하십시오."
84,5,RTEX 통신 사이클 이상 보호,"Although the NMNI221 (RTEX communication control ASIC) output a receive interrupt handling start signal, communication and servo went out of synchronizationdue to an output frequency problem with the signal.",Make sure that the host device can transmit the signal at the correct timing and speed.
,,,,The communication cycle set by Pr 7.20 (RTEX 통신 사이클 선택) must match the transmission cycle of the host device.
,,,,Check the communication cable for excessive noise.
,,,,"Check the communication cable for length, layout arrangement and connections."
,,,,Communication cable must be category 5-e or higher (6 or higher grade is recommended) shielded twisted pair cable (STPC) specified by TIA/EIA-568.
,,,,"Replace the cable with the one recommended as above, if not a recommended one."
,,,,Attach the ferrite core to the cable if effective.
86,0,RTEX 주기적 데이터 이상 보호 1,"A problem with the data (C/R and MAC-ID) in the cyclic command area, or a problem with the Sub_Chk in 32-byte 86 mode continued for a specified period.",Check the data in the cyclic command field (at location as described on the left column).
,,,,Check process performed on the host device.
86,1,RTEX 주기적 데이터 이상 보호 2,A problem with cyclic command code continued for a specified period.,Check the data in the cyclic command field (at location as described on the left column).
,,,,Check process performed on the host device.
87,0,강제 알람 입력 보호,강제 알람 입력(E-STOP)이 입력됨.,강제 알람 입력(E-STOP) 배선을 확인한다.
90,2,RTEX 다축 간 동기화 이상 보호,Communication error occurred or communication was lost during transition to synchronization establishment in full synchronization mode.,Check the communication cable for excessive noise.
,,,,"Check the communication cable for length, layout arrangement and connections."
,,,,Communication cable must be category 5-e or higher (6 or higher grade is recommended) shielded twisted pair cable (STPC) specified by TIA/EIA-568.
,,,,"Replace the cable with the one recommended as above, if not a recommended one."
,,,,Attach the ferrite core to the cable if effective.
91,1,RTEX 명령 이상 보호,"Inconsistency in communication frequency, semi-close/full-close, and combination of 16/32 byte mode and control mode.",Check the process of upper device for any problem.
,,,Control mode was switched at intervals shorter than 2 ms.,
,,,"Control mode was changed during profile position latch positioning/profile home position return (Type_Code = 12h, 13h, 31h, 32h, 33h).",
,,,Control mode was changed while non-cyclic command (Busy = 1) was processed.,
,,,"Home position return command (4h) was executed during profile position latch positioning/profile home position return (Type_Code = 12h, 13h, 31h, 32h, 33h).",
,,,"Initialization mode (Type_Code = 1??h, 31h) for home position return command (4h) was performed during profile positioning/profile continuous rotation (Type_Code = 10h, 11h, 20h).",
,,,Type_Code was changed during profile position control (pp).,
92,0,인코더 데이터 복구 이상 보호,"In the absolute mode with semi-closed control, internal position data has not been correctly initialized.",인코더 전원 전압 DC5V±5%(4.75~5.25V)를 확보한다. 특히 인코더선이 긴 경우 주의하십시오.
,,,,모터선과 인코더선이 함께 결속되어 있다면 분리한다.
,,,,인코더의 실드선을 FG에 연결한다.
92,1,외부 스케일 데이터 복구 이상 보호,"In the absolute mode with full-closed control, internal position data has not been correctly initialized.",외부 스케일의 전원 전압 DC5V±5%(4.75~5.25V)를 확보한다. 특히 외부 스케일 연결 케이블이 긴 경우 주의하십시오.
,,,,모터선과 외부 스케일 연결 케이블이 함께 결속되어 있다면 분리한다.
,,,,실드를 FＧ에 연결한다.
93,0,매개변수 설정 이상 보호 1,Electronic gear ratio exceeds the allowable range.,Check the setting value of the parameter.
,,,,Electronic gear ratio must be in the range 1/1000 to 1000.
93,2,매개변수 설정 이상 보호 2,External scale ratio exceeds acceptable range.,Check the setting value of the parameter.
,,,,External scale ratio must be in the range 1/40 to 160.
93,3,외부 스케일 접속 이상 보호,The communication type of the connected external scale (serial communication model) does not match the type selected through Pr3.23 '외부 스케일 타입 선택'.,Set Pr3.23 '외부 스케일 타입 선택' to the type of external scale connected.
93,5,매개변수 설정 이상 보호 4,The combination conditions of Pr7.20 (RTEX 통신 사이클 선택) and Pr7.21 (RTEX command update period) are not met.,Check settings of the parameters.
,,,,"For correct setting conditions, refer to the technical document, Specification of RTEX communication."
94,2,원점 복귀 이상 보호,An error with profile home position return occurred.,Check sensor installation status etc. for any problem.
95,0,모터 자동 인식 이상 보호,모터와 서보 앰프가 매치되지 않음.,취급 설명서에 기재된 서보 앰프와 모터를 올바르게 조합하여 사용한다.
95,1,모터 자동 인식 이상 보호,모터와 서보 앰프가 매치되지 않음.,취급 설명서에 기재된 서보 앰프와 모터를 올바르게 조합하여 사용한다.
